---

## Sales Amount
```dax
Sales Amount :=
SUMX ( Sales, Sales[Quantity] * Sales[Net Price] )
```

## Top customers
```sql
SELECT TOP ( 10 )
    c.CustomerName,
    SUM ( s.Quantity * s.NetPrice ) AS SalesAmount
FROM Sales AS s
JOIN Customer AS c
    ON c.CustomerKey = s.CustomerKey
GROUP BY c.CustomerName
ORDER BY SalesAmount DESC;
```

